This respondent demonstrates a sophisticated understanding of emotional intelligence *in theory* that is undermined by a protective impulse *in practice*. The debrief is genuinely excellent—it identifies the core problem with the roleplay with remarkable clarity. Yet the roleplay itself enacts the very problem being critiqued. This suggests either:

